WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:12.776
I MISS YOU.

00:00:33.859 --> 00:00:36.670
CAN YOU GIVE ME ANOTHER CHANCE?
I REALLY WANT TO SEE YOU.

00:00:44.587 --> 00:00:45.460
Excuse me.

00:00:46.519 --> 00:00:47.886
Are you Sun?

00:00:48.545 --> 00:00:50.658
No, I’m her big sister.

00:00:51.952 --> 00:00:57.934
So you are Chan, her twin sister?

00:00:58.569 --> 00:00:59.402
Yes.

00:01:01.449 --> 00:01:03.029
This is my first time

00:01:03.664 --> 00:01:06.861
meeting twins who are both beautiful.

00:01:07.779 --> 00:01:11.214
But I think you look prettier than your sister.

00:01:14.344 --> 00:01:15.551
I’m sorry.

00:01:16.398 --> 00:01:17.715
I don’t like men.

00:01:18.186 --> 00:01:19.366
I like women.

00:01:21.696 --> 00:01:23.514
You are sitting here alone.

00:01:24.149 --> 00:01:25.207
Don’t you feel lonely?

00:01:26.878 --> 00:01:28.225
Why don’t we drink together?

00:01:38.083 --> 00:01:40.338
Have you been waiting long, honey?

00:01:44.856 --> 00:01:46.622
Do you have something to say to my girlfriend?

00:01:48.528 --> 00:01:49.568
No.

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:02.963
Are you okay?

00:02:05.175 --> 00:02:07.419
I’m okay. Thank you.

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:10.642
Then…

00:02:11.701 --> 00:02:13.619
Can you buy me a glass of wine in return?

00:02:17.478 --> 00:02:18.867
Can I have a glass of wine?

00:02:51.157 --> 00:02:52.485
I’m Key.

00:02:53.718 --> 00:02:55.345
This is my first day working here.

00:02:56.333 --> 00:02:57.519
Nice to meet you.

00:03:01.049 --> 00:03:02.308
You’re a great singer.

00:03:04.072 --> 00:03:05.023
Thank you.

00:03:09.070 --> 00:03:10.476
Your tattoo.

00:03:11.676 --> 00:03:12.553
It’s pretty.

00:03:21.435 --> 00:03:22.864
I knew you would like it.

00:03:25.005 --> 00:03:26.356
I really like it.

00:03:27.391 --> 00:03:28.853
Why did you get the moon tattoo?

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:31.284
Is there a particular reason?

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:37.751
If you want to know, 
you need to come with me.

00:03:41.492 --> 00:03:42.887
You are quite flirty.

00:03:43.993 --> 00:03:45.239
Do you use that line a lot?

00:03:48.275 --> 00:03:50.320
I only use it with you, Chan.

00:04:02.253 --> 00:04:03.856
If I go with you,

00:04:05.644 --> 00:04:06.839
what will I get?

00:04:15.888 --> 00:04:17.243
I can give you everything

00:04:20.749 --> 00:04:22.294
that makes you happy.

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:30.880
Fine.

00:04:33.774 --> 00:04:35.101
But only for tonight.

00:04:37.501 --> 00:04:39.123
We’ll be together just tonight.

00:04:44.459 --> 00:04:46.370
What if you are addicted to me?

00:04:50.794 --> 00:04:52.095
Are you that good?

00:05:00.693 --> 00:05:02.237
I like your lipstick.

00:05:05.767 --> 00:05:07.068
It makes me want to kiss you.

00:05:08.762 --> 00:05:09.944
You want to kiss me?

00:05:11.544 --> 00:05:12.539
Then do it.

00:05:15.904 --> 00:05:16.892
Do you dare do it?

00:05:32.545 --> 00:05:33.664
Why are you so rushed?

00:05:35.076 --> 00:05:36.268
What else are you waiting for?

00:08:01.574 --> 00:08:02.756
Can you put your hand down?

00:08:08.902 --> 00:08:10.481
Try to relax.

00:08:10.481 --> 00:08:13.535
Be confident and send the energy to me.

00:08:16.053 --> 00:08:17.669
Be more confident.

00:08:19.128 --> 00:08:19.855
Relax.

00:08:20.749 --> 00:08:22.449
This brand is about confidence.

00:08:22.661 --> 00:08:23.740
Show it.

00:08:33.698 --> 00:08:34.933
Let’s take a break.

00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:39.611
Peach.

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:41.330
What’s wrong?

00:08:41.659 --> 00:08:43.039
Can we change the model?

00:08:43.321 --> 00:08:44.038
What?

00:08:44.767 --> 00:08:48.658
I don’t think she’s the right model
to represent the brand.

00:08:49.129 --> 00:08:52.993
The concept of this brand is 
clothes that give you confidence.

00:08:52.993 --> 00:08:54.957
The model has no confidence.

00:08:54.957 --> 00:08:56.658
We won’t get a good result from her.

00:08:56.658 --> 00:09:00.026
The brand specifically chose her.

00:09:00.026 --> 00:09:02.536
The model personally knows the company.

00:09:02.677 --> 00:09:04.366
If you insist on having her,

00:09:04.554 --> 00:09:06.093
I can’t continue to work.

00:09:06.422 --> 00:09:09.695
I’ll send you the contact info 
of other photographers.

00:09:09.695 --> 00:09:11.036
Calm down, Peach.

00:09:11.036 --> 00:09:15.550
The brand specifically asked for you.

00:09:18.656 --> 00:09:19.919
How about this?

00:09:20.248 --> 00:09:23.310
I’ll talk to the model.

00:09:29.028 --> 00:09:29.978
Peach.

00:09:30.472 --> 00:09:31.991
Key.

00:09:33.073 --> 00:09:34.483
When did you get here?

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:38.148
I got here 
when you were rebuking your client.

00:09:38.266 --> 00:09:39.453
You were scary.

00:09:40.841 --> 00:09:42.103
You don’t need to be scared.

00:09:42.360 --> 00:09:44.268
I’m always gentle with you.

00:09:45.327 --> 00:09:47.037
Why are you so tough with your client?

00:09:47.296 --> 00:09:48.520
Aren’t you afraid of losing them?

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:49.156
No.

00:09:49.673 --> 00:09:51.211
I’m not doing this for money.

00:09:51.399 --> 00:09:52.784
It’s just a hobby.

00:09:56.502 --> 00:09:58.120
A hobby?

00:09:58.426 --> 00:10:01.688
But you are the go-to photographer 
of the top actress.

00:10:02.229 --> 00:10:03.223
You mean Sun?

00:10:03.647 --> 00:10:07.526
We’ve been working together so often 
that we’re practically friends.

00:10:11.268 --> 00:10:15.596
Do you know her twin sister?

00:10:16.443 --> 00:10:18.983
I met her a few times.

00:10:19.383 --> 00:10:21.049
But I don’t know her personally.

00:10:24.273 --> 00:10:27.466
I just want to know if she’s seeing someone.

00:10:28.948 --> 00:10:30.260
Has she dated anyone before?

00:10:32.001 --> 00:10:33.255
I don’t know.

00:10:33.914 --> 00:10:36.890
She is hard to approach.

00:10:37.361 --> 00:10:38.876
She is very private.

00:10:39.017 --> 00:10:40.376
She is totally different from Sun.

00:10:41.388 --> 00:10:42.701
Why are you asking about her?

00:10:45.195 --> 00:10:46.605
I’m just curious.

00:10:47.029 --> 00:10:48.229
I think she’s pretty.

00:10:53.829 --> 00:10:54.546
Key.

00:10:55.628 --> 00:10:56.769
This Friday.

00:10:57.451 --> 00:10:59.590
Big Mom wants to hold 
a birthday celebration for Dad.

00:10:59.849 --> 00:11:01.164
Do you want to go home?

00:11:02.411 --> 00:11:06.044
They really miss you.

00:11:06.397 --> 00:11:08.036
They want you to visit them.

00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:21.696
If I don’t have a work schedule, I’ll go.

00:11:22.849 --> 00:11:23.486
Fine.

00:11:25.016 --> 00:11:27.317
Let me know if you’re coming.

00:11:30.823 --> 00:11:34.974
Chan, don’t you think the quotation is too high?

00:11:35.562 --> 00:11:38.177
I’m just renting space 
to open an Omakase restaurant.

00:11:39.001 --> 00:11:40.378
I’m not renting the entire floor.

00:11:40.543 --> 00:11:43.249
You know what kind of hotel the Crescent is.

00:11:43.578 --> 00:11:45.556
We always have VIP guests.

00:11:46.333 --> 00:11:49.144
The price I offer you is reasonable.

00:11:49.944 --> 00:11:51.586
I want the quotation for your friend,

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:54.134
not for business partners.

00:11:55.711 --> 00:11:58.202
When it comes to business, 
I don’t consider anyone my friend.

00:12:00.955 --> 00:12:03.650
My friend is so ruthless.

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:08.205
Why don’t you draft a contract?

00:12:08.205 --> 00:12:09.644
And we will discuss it again later.

00:12:11.856 --> 00:12:14.437
Many people want to open a restaurant 
in my hotel.

00:12:14.625 --> 00:12:15.640
If you don’t hurry…

00:12:15.640 --> 00:12:17.894
Fine. I got it.

00:12:18.271 --> 00:12:19.215
Then do as we’ve agreed on.

00:12:19.474 --> 00:12:20.082
Deal.

00:12:21.988 --> 00:12:22.764
Deal.

00:12:34.613 --> 00:12:37.673
Our college classmates are holding 
a reunion party early next month.

00:12:38.365 --> 00:12:39.463
Do you want to go with me?

00:12:40.334 --> 00:12:42.189
You haven’t seen our friends 
from the US for a while.

00:12:45.813 --> 00:12:46.522
No.

00:12:48.122 --> 00:12:49.019
Come on. Let’s go together.

00:12:50.101 --> 00:12:51.684
I said no.

00:12:51.990 --> 00:12:53.068
Stop pestering me.

00:13:34.324 --> 00:13:35.300
Simba.

00:13:35.676 --> 00:13:36.772
How are you doing?

00:13:39.690 --> 00:13:40.569
Are you lonely?

00:13:40.946 --> 00:13:43.704
Are you still mad at me?

00:13:44.834 --> 00:13:47.074
I didn’t come home just one night.

00:13:52.556 --> 00:13:53.902
He is so mad at me.

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:13.566
It was just one night.

00:14:20.672 --> 00:14:21.561
Here is your water.

00:14:37.096 --> 00:14:38.482
Why are you so pretty?

00:14:41.282 --> 00:14:42.679
Your eyes,

00:14:43.244 --> 00:14:44.293
your nose,

00:14:46.481 --> 00:14:47.483
and your lips.

00:14:51.601 --> 00:14:52.503
I’m sorry.

00:14:54.621 --> 00:14:55.623
Does it hurt?

00:14:58.659 --> 00:14:59.526
No.

00:15:00.232 --> 00:15:02.137
I want to know you more.

00:15:04.937 --> 00:15:05.844
Don’t.

00:15:06.833 --> 00:15:09.741
What happens between us is for tonight only.

00:15:12.235 --> 00:15:14.056
Won’t you see me again?

00:15:14.338 --> 00:15:15.005
No.

00:15:16.252 --> 00:15:17.789
What if we run into each other?

00:15:23.742 --> 00:15:24.985
It won’t happen.

00:15:31.504 --> 00:15:36.241
Do you know the idiom 
‘once in a blue moon’?

00:15:37.888 --> 00:15:39.447
It means rarely.

00:15:42.318 --> 00:15:46.864
A blue moon doesn’t happen often.

00:15:49.335 --> 00:15:51.299
But it doesn’t mean it’s impossible.

00:15:53.770 --> 00:15:54.876
What are you trying to say?

00:15:56.594 --> 00:15:58.197
I’m just saying

00:15:59.421 --> 00:16:01.275
if we run into each other again,

00:16:04.334 --> 00:16:08.798
it may be because we are somehow connected.

00:16:10.892 --> 00:16:12.257
It has nothing to do with it.

00:16:13.034 --> 00:16:15.206
What if we run into each other again?

00:16:17.159 --> 00:16:18.979
Will you give me a chance?

00:16:21.003 --> 00:16:21.786
Sure.

00:16:22.727 --> 00:16:25.018
If we run into each other,

00:16:26.148 --> 00:16:27.519
I may give you a chance.

00:16:29.096 --> 00:16:31.458
I guess she really forgot me.

00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:55.466
Once in a blue moon?

00:17:00.196 --> 00:17:01.339
Silly kid.

00:17:02.563 --> 00:17:03.701
She was talking nonsense.

00:17:26.631 --> 00:17:29.563
I met someone.

00:17:29.845 --> 00:17:31.531
So this one night,

00:17:31.908 --> 00:17:33.316
it must be really good.

